[[0,0,"<p>CHAPTER 15</p><p><button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Mark|15|1\">Mr 15:1-20</button>. Jesus Is Brought before Pilate--At a Second Hearing, Pilate, after Seeking to Release Him, Delivers Him Up--After Being Cruelly Entreated, He Is Led Away to Be Crucified. ( = <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Matthew|26|1\">Mt 26:1</button>, <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Matthew|26|2\">2</button>, <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Matthew|26|11\">11-31</button>; <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Luke|23|1\">Lu 23:1-6</button>, <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Luke|23|13\">13-25</button>; <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"John|18|28\">Joh 18:28-1</button>9:16).</p><p>See on <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"John|18|28\">Joh 18:28-1</button>9:16.</p><p><button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Mark|15|21\">Mr 15:21-37</button>. Crucifixion and Death of the Lord Jesus. ( = <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Matthew|27|32\">Mt 27:32-50</button>; <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Luke|23|26\">Lu 23:26-46</button>; <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"John|19|17\">Joh 19:17-30</button>).</p><p>See on <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"John|19|17\">Joh 19:17-30</button>.</p><p><button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Mark|15|38\">Mr 15:38-47</button>. Signs and Circumstances Following the Death of the Lord Jesus.--He Is Taken Down from the Cross and Buried--The Sepulchre Is Guarded. ( = <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Matthew|27|51\">Mt 27:51-66</button>; <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Luke|23|45\">Lu 23:45</button>, <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Luke|23|47\">47-56</button>; <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"John|19|31\">Joh 19:31-42</button>).</p><p>See on <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"Matthew|27|51\">Mt 27:51-56</button>; and <button class=\"xref\" data-k=\"John|19|31\">Joh 19:31-42</button>.</p>"]]